---
import AplusPage from '../../layouts/AplusPage.astro';
---
<AplusPage title="Workflow Wiki | A+ Active Services" eyebrow="Wiki / workflow" heading="The workflow is the product." intro="We document the real sequence before we pick the interface, automation, or integration.">
  <section class="aplus-screen-stack" aria-label="Workflow design method">
    <article>
      <p class="aplus-kicker">Discovery hierarchy</p>
      <h2>Needs become pain, impact, and urgency.</h2>
      <p>Do not stop at "we need AI." Pull the thread until the work has a time cost, money cost, risk cost, and a reason to act this quarter.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="aplus-kicker">Small win</p>
      <h2>The first workflow should be visible enough to sell.</h2>
      <p>Ship one reviewed path from trigger to result, then use it as the worked example for LinkedIn, YouTube, Slack, Substack, and office hours.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="aplus-content-grid">
    <article><h2>Map the handoff</h2><p>Name the person, artifact, decision, and next state at each step.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Find the paid pain</h2><p>Look for repeated manual work, delayed revenue, missed follow-up, or clinical risk.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Ship the smallest loop</h2><p>Build one complete path from trigger to result before expanding the system.</p></article>
  </section>
</AplusPage>
